E1: --think-max-tokens for the D0think cells (prereg v4 block H-b)

writer_request and derive take max_tokens (default: THINK_MAX_TOKENS for a
thinking request, else 700); HoldMem(think_max_tokens=...) passes it to
the thinking writer's requests only. The E1 driver threads the flag
(default 8192), gives the thinking client proportionally more time above
the default and records the limit in the manifest's think_writer params.

tests/test_e1_round3_pins.py pins the requests (writer, thinking writer,
program), items and probe questions of the existing cells at the defaults
on two small worlds, with digests taken on 6742a41 (before round 3).

